Quaver Mono and Quaver Mono Condensed are monospace remixes of Quaver by
Nathan Scott (caffinate), https://caffinate.itch.io/quaver

Quaver is released by its author under Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain dedication): https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode

The remixes are generated by nib.ref from the original glyph bitmaps; every
changed glyph is listed with its rule in quaver-mono-exceptions.txt and
quaver-mono-condensed-exceptions.txt in the nib repository.
